BUILDSCRIPT FOLDER README
\fs34 \
\
The buildscripts folder contains the buildscripts used to build the binaries in the installer package. For further instructions, see the section 
\f1\b How to build
\f0\b0  below.\

\fs48 \
\
DIFFS FOLDER README
\fs34 \
\
The diffs folder contains the patches that were applied to the FreePascal sources published on github {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://github.com/fpc/FPCSource"}}{\fldrslt https://github.com/fpc/FPCSource}} . Each .diff file has a description in the header of what it does.\
\
\
\

\fs48 WINDRES FOLDER README
\fs34 \
\
The windres folder contains a macOS windres binary. It can be used (on macOS) to compile Windows .rc files into .res files. There is a separate file that explains how to build windres from sources. Please note that home-brewed versions of windres, ignoring these instructions, may not work correctly.\
\
\
\

