\f1\b \cf0 What's included
\f0\b0 \
\
This package contains the fpc-3.3.1 FreePascal compiler for macOS. It is patched from development sources of the FreePascal 3.3.1 compiler. The sources are those from FreePascal fpc main {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://gitlab.com/freepascal.org/fpc/source"}}{\fldrslt https://gitlab.com/freepascal.org/fpc/source}} commit {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://github.com/fpc/FPCSource/commit/ee72937977c455f90467c5e8b5775b96560932ae"}}{\fldrslt https://github.com/fpc/FPCSource/commit/ee72937977c455f90467c5e8b5775b96560932ae}}.\
\
\

